WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.350
"Ugh!" Sid said.

2
00:00:05.351 --> 00:00:14.884
"My tail is stuck again!"

3
00:00:14.885 --> 00:00:20.088
Rex and Tor pulled again.

4
00:00:20.089 --> 00:00:23.095
The spike didn't move.

5
00:00:23.096 --> 00:00:26.817
Tor sighed.

6
00:00:26.818 --> 00:00:31.909
"The spike is deeper this time."

7
00:00:31.910 --> 00:00:33.657
Rex nodded.

8
00:00:33.658 --> 00:00:41.695
"We can't pull it out."

9
00:00:41.696 --> 00:00:47.873
Tor looked through her bag.

10
00:00:47.874 --> 00:00:54.393
She found an ax.

11
00:00:54.394 --> 00:00:56.927
"I'll chop down the tree."

12
00:00:56.928 --> 00:01:01.097
"What?" Sid gulped.

13
00:01:01.098 --> 00:01:06.350
"I'll help!" A dinosaur ran over.

14
00:01:06.351 --> 00:01:08.898
She had three horns.

15
00:01:08.899 --> 00:01:13.012
She stood near the tree.

16
00:01:13.013 --> 00:01:16.877
"I can use my horns."

17
00:01:16.878 --> 00:01:22.113
She wiggled one horn.

18
00:01:22.114 --> 00:01:29.611
Slowly . . . the spike slid out!

19
00:01:29.612 --> 00:01:35.342
"Phew!" Sid said. "Thank you!"

20
00:01:35.343 --> 00:01:39.763
The dinosaur smiled. "I'm Sara."

21
00:01:39.764 --> 00:01:43.334
Sid grinned. "I'm Sid.

22
00:01:43.335 --> 00:01:49.089
They are Rex and Tor."

23
00:01:49.090 --> 00:01:52.908
"Let's play tag," Sara said.

24
00:01:52.909 --> 00:01:53.970
"You're it!"

25
00:01:53.971 --> 00:02:00.902
She tagged Rex and then ran.

26
00:02:00.903 --> 00:02:03.744
Rex chased everyone.

27
00:02:03.745 --> 00:02:06.785
"This is fun," Rex thought.

28
00:02:06.786 --> 00:02:14.614
"New friends!"

